===Etymology===
From {{der|is|non|jǫkull}}, from {{der|is|gem-pro|*jekulaz}}. Diminutive of {{m|non|jaki||a piece of ice, broken ice}}.<ref>[https://web.archive.org/web/20160304185530/http://web.ff.cuni.cz/cgi-bin/uaa_slovnik/gmc_search_v3?cmd=viewthis&id=cv:b0327:35 JÖKULL] from Cleasby/Vigfusson</ref><ref name="da">[http://ordnet.dk/ddo/ordbog?query=j%C3%B8kel jøkel substantiv, fælleskøn]</ref>

